+				 * Do not register bq24190's own (deprecated)
+				 * "bq24190-battery" power supply. The real gauge
+				 * is the MT6323 AUXADC one in douglas-battery.c,
+				 * which used to call power_supply_unregister() on
+				 * bq24190's battery psy to take over the name -
+				 * freeing it behind the owning driver, which still
+				 * held the pointer in bdi->battery. That left
+				 * bq24190_pm_resume()'s
